          "why": "Equal footing requires every method to receive the same pre-filtered gene space, so the informative genes have already been chosen identically for all methods. DWLS's own differential-expression pass is then a second filter, not a second opinion: at the published cutoffs it left 31 genes for 8 cell types and the driver refused to deconvolve on them.",
